 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "...Uh-huh...": "",
  "There's just something about you... It's like you stepped right out of a romance drama and into my life...": "",
  "Ahaha... that's hilarious.": "",
  "So... shall we get going?": "",
  "Ooh, where to?": "",
  "I thought I'd ask you ladies.": "",
  "Hmm, I really don't mind, as long as we can all have fun together!": "",
  "How about darts? That'd be good for three people.": "",
  "Sounds like a plan.": "",
  "Have you ever played darts before, Yukko-san?": "",
  "No, it's actually my very first time! I can't wait for you to teach me!": "",
  "Lucky you, Yukko. You've got yourself a handsome coach now.": "",
  "I sure do! Thanks for bringing him along, Nanami!": "",
  "Well, let's start with the basics.": "",
  "Did you get all that?": "",
  "Got it! Not only are you easy on the eyes, but you're easy to learn from, too!": "",
  "Haha, really? Good, then let's get started.": "",
  "You win, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Sorry. I thought I was going soft on you...": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san... Soft or hard, you can go on me <font_kind=yakuza_italic>any</font_kind> time...": "",
  "I gotta say, Yagami-san, that was pretty impressive.": "",
  "Wasn't it!?": "",
  "A tie...": "",
  "I didn't know something like this could even happen.": "",
  "I bet it's 'cause we think alike! Right!?": "",
  "Huh? Did I actually... win?": "",
  "Yukko, you said this was your first time, right?": "",
  "Ahahaha! Maybe I'm a darts prodigy!": "",
  "Now that we had our fun, why don't we sit down and talk for a while?": "",
  "Yes, definitely! Let's pour out our hearts to each other!": "",
  "Eeeeeeee, you guys don't know how <font_kind=yakuza_italic>excited</font_kind> I am right now! This is totally like a matchmaking session!": "",
  "Then why don't I play the role of matchmaker. Show him what you got, Yukko.": "",
  "Oooooh, I'll show him everything I have to offer!": "",
  "(I guess Nanami-san doesn't consider herself dating material... Or maybe she thinks that way about me...?)": "",
  "(Now what should I talk about with these two?)": "",
  "Yukko-san, you said you work at an office here in Tokyo?": "",
  "I do! I'm a secretary at a stationery company!": "",
  "Stationery, huh? That's neat.": "",
  "Isn't it!? What's your favorite kind?": "",
  "Of stationery? Now there's a question...": "",
  "Come on, Yukko. Do you really think he's into stuff like that?": "",
  "Ahahaha, you're right. I guess I'm just so into stationery, I automatically assume everyone else is too!": "",
  "But you know... my true passion... is theater! Theatrical arts, to be precise.": "",
  "Theater, huh?": "",
  "Yup. Yukko's been a stage performer ever since we went to college.": "",
  "Wow, so you're an actor?": "",
  "Yeah. It's a shame Nanami doesn't come to any of my shows, though.": "",
  "I told you, I've been very busy lately!": "",
  "You say that every time, but I know you're just not interested.": "",
  "Come on, that's not true at all.": "",
  "By the way, Yukko-san. You said you two have been friends for how long?": "",
  "Since middle school!": "",
  "I knew from the very day we met, we'd end up being besties for life!": "",
  "Hmm. And what was it about her that made you think that?": "",
  "Well, as soon as I saw her, I just had this feeling... It was like being hit by lightning. Have you ever felt that way?": "",
  "Just recently, as a matter of fact. It was when I first laid eyes on Nanami-san.": "",
  "What!? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Me</font_kind>?": "",
  "Yup. It felt like a high-voltage current coursing through my body.": "",
  "You sure it wasn't just static electricity?": "",
  "Uh.": "",
  "Oh... huh. Maybe it was. No wonder it felt so shocking!": "",
  "Oh. My. God. That was <font_kind=yakuza_italic>too</font_kind> cute, Yagami-san!": "",
  "I'm serious. Static electricity really does build up around this time of year.": "",
  "But Nanami. I bet you felt a nice little zing the moment you saw Yagami-san, right?": "",
  "Just what are you implying?": "",
  "I actually have felt something like that. It was when I first saw you, Yukko-san.": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Really</font_kind>!? So did I! It was like a powerful jolt of electricity was running rampant through my body...": "",
  "You always say that whenever there's a nice-looking guy around.": "",
  "Ahahaha, don't I know it! But Yagami-san's something special. Looking at him was more like a... a megavolt!": "",
  "You'd be dead if that were true.": "",
  "Well, my heart did skip a few beats, that's for sure!": "",
  "But I'm sure you felt the same way, right? I saw it in your eyes!": "",
  "Oh? Is that true?": "",
  "Yeah! The way she looked at you... it was like a flower opening up to blossom! Like she was asking to be pollinated!": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>P-Pollinated</font_kind>!?": "",
  "Hey! I am <font_kind=yakuza_italic>not</font_kind> a flower, and I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>definitely</font_kind> don't need to be \"pollinated\"!": "",
  "And Yukko, you need to stop giving this guy the wrong impression!": "",
  "But Nanami, you said it yourself... that you finally met a guy who amazed you.": "",
  "Wait, that's not what I...": "",
  "I think it was just after the first time you two met.": "",
  "Nanami said you were amazing, reliable, and someone she could actually respect.": "",
  "Oh wow... I'm honored.": "",
  "Geez, Yukko! You really can't keep a secret, can you!": "",
  "Well, I'm glad she said what she did. That makes me really happy.": "",
  "Oh come on... I said that purely out of gratitude... I mean, I do respect certain aspects of you...": "",
  "Girl, you would not stop raving about this guy. \"He's got this unique perspective, does everything his own way\"—": "",
  "Hey! Did I not just tell you to stop saying things like that!?": "",
  "What, I'm trying to help you out here! Besides, you both look like a perfectly natural couple. Bet you'd make some real cute babies!": "",
  "Gosh, Yukko. You still get attached to the wrong idea and run with it as far as it can go. You haven't changed a bit.": "",
  "And I'm saying that you have. When was the last time you ever complimented a guy, if at all? You used to hate men.": "",
  "Whoa, really?": "",
  "That's... a rather extreme way of putting it.": "",
  "I guess you're just a really special guy, Yagami-san.": "",
  "...Don't take her too seriously, okay? This girl <font_kind=yakuza_italic>loves</font_kind> to talk.": "",
  "(Seems like these two really know each other. I wonder what other secrets Yukko-san will let slip...)": "",
  "Hey, I know. Since we're all sitting here together, I wanted to ask you both... What's your ideal kind of guy?": "",
  "You're asking me, too?": "",
  "Well, I'm pretty sure you're the embodiment of Nanami's perfect man.": "",
  "You said you'd only get with a man you could respect, right?": "",
  "Why are you focusing on me all of a sudden?": "",
  "Because you already know my answer, don't you?": "",
  "\"As long as he's good-looking, he's good to go.\"": "",
  "Took the words right out of my mouth.": "",
  "(Is that seriously her only criteria?)": "",
  "So you like someone you can respect? That's a good place to start.": "",
  "It's also a tough place to start, given how few have earned it.": "",
  "True. Respect isn't something that can be handed out to just anyone. That's why it's so valuable.": "",
  "Sounds like you know a lot about that. Is there someone you admire in particular?": "",
  "Hmm... it's kinda hard to say.": "",
  "Hmm, I can think of several people I can respect.": "",
  "Yeah. As long as you're not expecting perfection, I think there's something to respect in just about anyone.": "",
  "...Hmm. I suppose that's one way of looking at it. Interesting.": "",
  "Better watch out, Yagami-san. As you may have noticed, Nanami's looks can kill, but her heart is even deadlier.": "",
  "Should I be scared?": "",
  "Hey, just what are you trying to say here?": "",
  "Only that you're really good at attracting men without realizing it and then pushing them away once you do.": "",
  "You see, Nanami's incredibly capable on her own, plus she's super smart. So she never gives guys any leeway.": "",
  "Come on, that's totally not how it is.": "",
  "You sure? What about all those guys you rejected back in high school? And in college? And after you started working?": "",
  "You even brushed off that really sexy hunk back in our senior year. I still can't believe you did that!": "",
  "Well, I wasn't into him. What else should I have done?": "",
  "Were you always that independent, Nanami-san?": "",
  "...Maybe so.": "",
  "You're asking what he was like?": "",
  "...I choose not to remember.": "",
  "Yagami-san, that's the one thing you can't bring up around Nanami!": "",
  "Oh? Is that so?": "",
  "Please disregard that. Yukko's just being her usual overdramatic self.": "",
  "Not necessarily. I just happen to have a really amazing job that I enjoy more than anything.": "",
  "But isn't that kind of an excuse not to try? What if all your opportunities disappear?": "",
  "Then let them. I'm perfectly fine with how things are.": "",
  "Are you really okay with losing your shot at happiness?": "",
  "My <font_kind=yakuza_italic>career</font_kind> is how I define my happiness.": "",
  "Oh? Then what about the saying, \"A woman's happiness is love and marriage\"?": "",
  "Yet another antiquated ideology manufactured by the mass media.": "",
  "What does that even mean!?": "",
  "Hey, no need to get upset over it. It's okay to agree to disagree about something.": "",
  "Yukko-san, if you only had a couple words to describe Nanami-san, what would those be?": "",
  "Hmm. As a fellow woman, I would say... Cool yet cute, stylish yet smart, and... I guess very hard-working.": "",
  "Wow. Those are some good compliments.": "",
  "Oh, she's just trying to make you like me.": "",
  "No, I was totally being serious. You've always had the best grades out of all us girls. Plus you're still the prettiest.": "",
  "...Are you even interested in hearing this nonsense, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Oh yes. I'm very interested.": "",
  "...Why?": "",
  "I've always been the curious type. Especially about people I'm getting to know.": "",
  "What about you, Nanami-san?": "",
  "Are you asking... if I'm interested in you?": "",
  "I know for a fact she is!": "",
  "Y-Yukko...": "",
  "I'd like to think I understand Nanami pretty well by now.": "",
  "Are you actually interested in me, Nanami-san?": "",
  "...Well, I think you're a very interesting person...": "",
  "I suppose I should be glad to hear that.": "",
  "Now then. Maybe we should start heading out?": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san, why don't you exchange numbers with Yukko?": "",
  "Sure, that's a good idea.": "",
  "...Hey, Nanami.": "",
  "Me being friendly with Yagami-san doesn't bother you at all?": "",
  "Why would it?": "",
  "...Well, as long as it's all right with you, I guess it's fine.": "",
  "...Okay then?": "",
  "C'mon Yagami-san, let's see that smartphone.": "",
  "So, Yukko. Did you enjoy yourself today?": "",
  "Oh yeah! And I'm assuming you did, too?": "",
  "I sure hope she did.": "",
  "Don't worry, I had fun.": "",
  "Why don't you go on a date next time, just the two of you?": "",
  "You don't have to be so blunt, Yukko.": "",
  "Well, thanks for coming out today.": "",
  "No, thank you for taking us.": "",
  "Let's keep in touch, okay?": "",
  "Yukko, did you have a good time today?": "",
  "I sure did. But... I can't quite say the same for you, Nanami.": "",
  "Oh? Is that right?": "",
  "That's not true, I was just a little... tired.": "",
  "I figured...": "",
  "Hehe, I bet you were just nervous being around the only guy you've liked in years.": "",
  "Hey, stop making things up.": "",
  "...Hey there. Sorry to drag you out like this.": "",
  "Actually, I'm happy to help! I mean, we're going on a real detective case here... There's no way I'd pass that up!": "",
  "Do you have any problem acting like a couple?": "",
  "Not at all! In fact, I've been doing extensive mental preparation just for this!": "",
  "You sure seem excited.": "",
  "Well, an opportunity like this only comes around once in a blue moon... Is the target here yet?": "",
  "She should be showing up any minute now...": "",
  "Ah, there she is.": "",
  "That's who we're looking for?": "",
  "Wow, she sticks out like a sore thumb.": "",
  "Huh? I feel like I've seen her around before...": "",
  "...Maybe that's just your imagination?": "",
  "Yeah, you're probably right.": "",
  "Uh. I wouldn't stare too much at the target if I were you. Otherwise she might catch on to us.": "",
  "Oh, you're right. I'm sorry.": "",
  "Avoid unneccessary eye contact. That's one of the basics of investigation.": "",
  "Roger that, sir!": "",
  "(Nanami knows Yukko so well, she might be able to recognize her even at a subconscious level...)": "",
  "(We should definitely keep our distance.)": "",
  "All right. So we're gonna do our best to follow her around without being noticed.": "",
  "Is this what you call tailing?": "",
  "Yep. Whatever actions we take from here on out, we need to be absolutely sure not to raise her suspicion.": "",
  "Looking at her face is especially off-limits.": "",
  "Understood! I'll be careful not to mess things up!": "",
  "Ooh, I wonder what she's up to...": "",
  "Uh-oh! I think she's starting to notice us!": "",
  "(I didn't ask her to go over the top like that...)": "",
  "You know... she really does remind me of someone. Who could that be...?": "",
  "(Ahh... This is not good!)": "",
  "Wait, is that... a UFO up there!?": "",
  "What? Where!?": "",
  "Hey, is this even the time to be worrying about something like that?": "",
  "Sorry. Must've been my imagination.": "",
  "Geez, keep it together. Besides, I'm almost positive I know her from somewhere...": "",
  "(Dang. Looks like this is my only way out...)": "",
  "Ahh! What are you doing?": "",
  "Shh. We need to pretend like we're a couple.": "",
  "R-Right.": "",
  "(Why do you keep looking this way...)": "",
  "This is getting kinda embarrassing...": "",
  "(Are you gonna be staring at us this whole time?)": "",
  "(Give... her... a... big... wet... kiss...?)": "",
  "(Is that what she's trying to tell me?)": "",
  "(Be... fore... it's... too... late...)": "",
  "Man. For a second there, I thought it was all over.": "",
  "Yeah. Our cover was almost blown, huh?": "",
  "R-Right. That's what I meant.": "",
  "All right. Let's go see what she's up to.": "",
  "You think she's having a little rendezvous with her secret lover inside?": "",
  "Only one way to find out.": "",
  "Guess we'll have to play the waiting game.": "",
  "(All right. Now's my chance to talk to her.)": "",
  "...Well, instead of just waiting around, we might as well talk about something. That's what a normal couple would do.": "",
  "I wanted to say this earlier, but thanks for helping me out today.": "",
  "No problem. I've always wondered how detectives do their jobs, so I'm glad you let me tag along.": "",
  "And besides. People who cheat should be punished.": "",
  "It's pretty disrespectful, I'll say that much. Sad thing is, I see it happen over and over again in this line of work.": "",
  "Why... do you think that is?": "",
  "Simple. It's the trappings of the male sex drive.": "",
  "Your <font_kind=yakuza_italic>sex drive</font_kind>!?": "",
  "Yeah. I'm talking about our survival instinct. The more we procreate, the greater our chances of passing down our DNA.": "",
  "That instinct fuels the sex drive, so cheating is more of a physical factor than an emotional one.": "",
  "So what you're saying is... men can't help it if they cheat? That they should be excused for it?": "",
  "I mean... this is some hardwired biological programming we're talking about here. We're all just animals deep down.": "",
  "Uh, you know I'm kidding, right?": "",
  "I honestly think cheating is a bad thing.": "",
  "Do you really?": "",
  "I wouldn't say that. After all, you can't let things like instinct and desire rule your life.": "",
  "Even though it's biologically coded into your system?": "",
  "Yeah. For example, finding yourself attracted to other women does happen, even if you do have a partner...": "",
  "But when you consider the love and trust you built together, submitting to that drive is entirely out of the question.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
